      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON FUMIKO (3) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a neck second (22.80) behind Lakeview Mitch at Geelong. Won at her only start from this box. Capable of going well again. SEATS TWO (4) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a neck (22.60) behind Border Beast at this track. Can measure up. BUSH CIRCUS (2) sailed across from an outside draw and gave a sight, holding on for third and beaten 2.75 lengths (22.57) at this track in a Grade 5 over 390m. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from six starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. PAW WHISPER (7) is right in the mix.",
